# DrawingBoard Capital - Notion OS Setup
#
# Step 1: Create a Notion Integration
#   → Go to https://www.notion.so/my-integrations
#   → Click "New integration"
#   → Name it "DrawingBoard Capital OS"
#   → Copy the "Internal Integration Secret" below
#
NOTION_API_KEY=secret_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Step 2: Get your Parent Page ID
#   → In Notion, open (or create) the page where you want the OS to live
#   → Click "Share" → "Invite" → find your integration and invite it
#   → Copy the page URL. It looks like:
#     https://www.notion.so/Your-Page-Name-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
#   → The 32-character hex string at the end is your page ID
#   → Format it with dashes: xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
#
NOTION_PARENT_PAGE_ID=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
